<!--
  Intentionally (almost) empty.

  MSBuild walks upwards until it finds the first Directory.Build.props. This file
  stops that search at "libs/", so that the build settings of EEBusConformanceTests
  are NOT imposed on the submodules (Hermod, Styx, WWCP_EEBus, ...). Those repositories
  bring their own settings and are built with their own warning levels.
-->
